WEBVTT

00:01.745 --> 00:03.081
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:03.105 --> 00:04.441
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.465 --> 00:07.681
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.705 --> 00:13.265
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.265 --> 01:31.225
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.385 --> 01:34.625
=Episode 15=

01:35.468 --> 01:37.628
(Mount Qingcheng Qingyang Sect)

02:04.720 --> 02:06.145
Where's Wu Lingsu?

02:08.245 --> 02:09.495
Look at the stone tablet.

02:10.270 --> 02:11.870
It's the handwriting
of the late emperor.

02:12.470 --> 02:14.595
(Dismount from Horse)
No matter who you are,

02:15.025 --> 02:16.720
get off your horses.

02:17.020 --> 02:18.545
The calligraphy is poorly written.

02:19.895 --> 02:20.945
Presumptuous.

02:31.245 --> 02:32.245
Take position.

02:38.095 --> 02:39.695
Shenxiao Sword Array.

02:40.520 --> 02:42.345
Who would like to break it?

03:04.345 --> 03:05.670
Maybe someone else.

03:05.945 --> 03:07.745
He can't break the array.

04:05.920 --> 04:07.595
He surprises me.

04:08.970 --> 04:10.825
The move he used was Chixia.

04:12.985 --> 04:14.270
Is it a sophisticated move?

04:14.445 --> 04:15.445
I doubt it.

04:15.820 --> 04:17.070
It only works

04:17.105 --> 04:18.305
by exhausting qi and blood.

04:18.770 --> 04:20.571
The more he uses it,
the more badly he gets hurt.

04:20.595 --> 04:21.646
People who practice the move

04:21.670 --> 04:22.695
don't live long.

04:46.745 --> 04:47.895
How did he learn it?

04:48.045 --> 04:49.045
His Lordship taught him.

04:49.645 --> 04:50.695
Did Xu Xiao trick him?

05:08.370 --> 05:09.441
Doesn't he know

05:09.465 --> 05:11.145
the move may take his life?

05:12.520 --> 05:13.520
He knows.

05:16.265 --> 05:17.570
Have you made up your mind?

05:18.770 --> 05:19.945
Though the swordplay

05:20.445 --> 05:21.870
is powerful,

05:22.795 --> 05:24.505
people who practice it

05:25.185 --> 05:26.795
die quickly.

05:27.370 --> 05:29.096
As long as I can exchange
a slim chance of survival for Lin Family

05:29.120 --> 05:31.105
with my life,

05:31.645 --> 05:33.145
I'm willing to die

05:35.520 --> 05:37.045
thousands of times.

05:38.220 --> 05:39.220
Give him.

05:45.095 --> 05:49.445
(Chixia Swordplay)

06:09.245 --> 06:10.395
Let's bet

06:10.470 --> 06:12.385
how long can he hold out.

06:13.445 --> 06:15.270
My guess is

06:16.070 --> 06:17.245
two hours.

06:18.745 --> 06:19.745
Give him a hand.

06:23.870 --> 06:24.870
Me?

06:30.820 --> 06:32.095
If Your Highness

06:32.570 --> 06:33.620
says so.

06:43.370 --> 06:44.410
- Despicable.
- Despicable.

06:45.445 --> 06:47.081
He has to fight all of you
by himself,

06:47.105 --> 06:48.246
yet you think we're despicable?

06:48.270 --> 06:49.270
I don't think it's fair.

07:39.470 --> 07:41.095
It was Yuxiao Array just now.

07:41.145 --> 07:42.696
Now it's the real

07:42.720 --> 07:44.045
Shenxiao Sword Array.

07:44.920 --> 07:45.920
It's powerful.

07:46.420 --> 07:47.745
Only God of Sword

07:48.020 --> 07:49.020
can break it.

07:54.385 --> 07:55.495
Don't you take action?

07:55.770 --> 07:57.345
I will if you take me as your master.

07:58.395 --> 07:59.595
Forget it.

08:05.970 --> 08:07.495
Let me try.

08:07.545 --> 08:08.305
Your Highness.

08:08.420 --> 08:09.420
Your Highness.

08:10.320 --> 08:11.695
Don't put yourself at risk.

08:12.120 --> 08:13.521
I made the trouble.

08:13.545 --> 08:14.820
I can't just look on.

08:17.920 --> 08:19.545
I'll fight with you.

08:27.585 --> 08:28.585
Your Highness.

08:28.825 --> 08:30.241
The dead and wounded
have been sent back.

08:30.265 --> 08:31.745
Fengzi Battalion report for duty.

08:32.470 --> 08:33.695
Just in time.

08:36.745 --> 08:38.196
Stone tablet left by the late emperor.

08:38.220 --> 08:40.025
World-famous Shenxiao Sword Array.

08:40.495 --> 08:42.070
Dare you break it with me?

08:44.845 --> 08:45.845
Take position.

09:03.505 --> 09:04.820
Who are you, if I may ask?

09:05.345 --> 09:06.845
Xu Fengnian.

09:08.120 --> 09:09.385
Son of Lord of North Liang?

09:12.185 --> 09:14.545
(Mount Qingcheng)
We're in Qingcheng instead of North Liang.

09:14.895 --> 09:16.395
You invaded our place.

09:17.845 --> 09:19.345
What do you want?

09:21.145 --> 09:22.995
There is a bandit called Old Meng,

09:23.245 --> 09:25.025
a little girl called Xiaoque'er

09:25.625 --> 09:27.895
and a bunch of bandits
following Old Meng.

09:28.265 --> 09:29.545
I must find them all,

09:29.585 --> 09:31.470
no matter dead or alive.

09:33.025 --> 09:34.220
We've never seen them.

09:35.745 --> 09:37.345
I have nothing to say, then.

09:41.795 --> 09:42.905
Mr. Xu.

09:45.245 --> 09:46.295
Xiaoque'er.

09:59.025 --> 10:00.895
Wu Lingsu, Lord of Qingcheng.

10:01.370 --> 10:03.225
You've come all the way.

10:03.695 --> 10:05.195
Why don't you come with me

10:05.495 --> 10:07.855
(Lord of Qingcheng Wu Lingsu)
to enjoy the mountain scenery?

10:10.905 --> 10:11.905
Fine.

10:12.670 --> 10:13.761
You can

10:13.785 --> 10:15.645
come alone.

10:16.225 --> 10:17.225
Please don't.

10:17.825 --> 10:18.825
OK.

10:19.370 --> 10:20.870
I'll go by myself.

10:29.195 --> 10:30.195
You've had a long day.

10:30.245 --> 10:31.465
You can retire now.

10:32.120 --> 10:33.520
We haven't arrived in Qingzhou yet.

10:34.770 --> 10:35.770
You can't die.

10:36.520 --> 10:37.520
Of course.

10:53.170 --> 10:54.345
Get ready.

10:55.445 --> 10:56.372
If anything goes wrong,

10:56.396 --> 10:57.720
(Mount Qingcheng)

10:58.105 --> 10:59.420
flatten the mountain.

11:04.620 --> 11:05.881
Is he out of his mind?

11:05.905 --> 11:07.895
He goes alone, really?

11:08.770 --> 11:09.870
Girl,

11:10.895 --> 11:12.095
aren't you worried?

11:15.020 --> 11:16.545
He is a hundred percent safe.

11:16.585 --> 11:17.745
Why should I be worried?

11:19.620 --> 11:21.945
Are you sure I will save him?

11:22.795 --> 11:24.065
I'll bet you 500 coins

11:25.120 --> 11:27.305
that without your help,

11:27.345 --> 11:29.385
Xu Fengnian still can
get out of the jaws of danger.

11:31.645 --> 11:33.241
He hasn't mastered the skill
of using his blade.

11:33.265 --> 11:34.625
He can't do that.

11:34.795 --> 11:35.795
Do you bet?

11:35.870 --> 11:36.870
Yes.

11:38.395 --> 11:39.670
Shall we sneak in?

11:44.720 --> 11:45.720
Here we are.

12:03.795 --> 12:04.795
Xiaoque'er.

12:05.070 --> 12:06.070
Go inside first.

12:22.445 --> 12:23.670
You surprised me.

12:23.995 --> 12:24.922
Your Highness,

12:24.946 --> 12:26.345
you dare come in.

12:29.820 --> 12:30.845
Turn them over to me now.

12:32.045 --> 12:33.345
You ran the risk of

12:33.745 --> 12:35.705
provoking Qingyang Sect
just for the village girl?

12:35.845 --> 12:36.845
Make your bargains.

12:37.720 --> 12:40.270
Were the man and woman
who broke the array

12:40.545 --> 12:41.770
your guards?

12:42.170 --> 12:43.695
They showed no respect to us.

12:43.970 --> 12:45.265
I want them to die.

12:45.320 --> 12:45.995
Fine.

12:46.245 --> 12:47.082
Give me what I want.

12:47.106 --> 12:48.270
I'll turn them over to you.

12:49.245 --> 12:50.705
I want you to go out now

12:51.295 --> 12:52.720
and take their heads to me.

12:53.070 --> 12:54.570
That's not the deal.

12:55.995 --> 12:57.395
I'm not making a deal with you.

12:58.170 --> 12:59.970
Once you come to my place,

13:00.395 --> 13:01.825
your life is in my hands.

13:02.420 --> 13:03.845
You have no choice.

13:03.985 --> 13:05.570
He didn't fall for the trap.

13:07.620 --> 13:09.920
What do you think he would do?

13:10.470 --> 13:11.545
What he would do?

13:12.245 --> 13:13.920
Fight, if he fails to make a deal.

13:14.445 --> 13:15.785
Dare he fight against him?

13:15.945 --> 13:17.185
What's there to fear?

13:17.585 --> 13:19.281
It's Wu Lingsu who will find it hard

13:19.305 --> 13:20.865
being on thin ice.

13:39.770 --> 13:40.761
Do you want to die?

13:40.785 --> 13:42.396
I'll give you a chance.

13:42.420 --> 13:43.420
Bring them to me.

13:43.905 --> 13:44.905
But your life

13:45.070 --> 13:46.520
is in my hands now.

13:47.220 --> 13:49.020
Fengzi Battalion is waiting
outside your gate.

13:49.385 --> 13:50.521
Everyone saw me

13:50.545 --> 13:51.761
coming with you.

13:51.785 --> 13:52.945
To kill me,

13:53.345 --> 13:54.821
you'd better think

13:54.845 --> 13:56.645
if you're capable of
killing all my men first.

13:56.770 --> 13:58.010
As long as one of them escapes,

13:58.470 --> 14:00.225
Xu Xiao will
lead North Liang Cavalry here

14:00.265 --> 14:01.465
to flatten the mountain.

14:01.545 --> 14:02.625
After killing you,

14:02.795 --> 14:04.355
I'll return to the capital immediately.

14:04.670 --> 14:05.945
I don't think Xu Xiao

14:06.505 --> 14:07.681
can catch up with me.

14:07.705 --> 14:08.705
He doesn't have to.

14:09.070 --> 14:11.081
Your family will be turned over
to North Liang.

14:11.105 --> 14:11.795
You're lying!

14:12.095 --> 14:13.241
They'll trade your family's life

14:13.265 --> 14:14.305
for Xu Xiao's retreat.

14:14.595 --> 14:15.795
It gains ten thousand percent.

14:25.395 --> 14:26.570
You lose.

14:27.920 --> 14:29.865
You knew it in the very beginning?

14:30.305 --> 14:31.870
It's easy to guess.

14:32.425 --> 14:34.195
How dare they

14:34.505 --> 14:36.585
kill the son of Lord of North Liang
in public?

14:36.970 --> 14:38.681
Does he come alone because

14:38.705 --> 14:39.895
he has nothing to fear?

14:40.170 --> 14:40.845
Yeah.

14:41.145 --> 14:42.465
He is too cunning

14:42.705 --> 14:43.985
to risk his own life.

14:45.795 --> 14:47.995
I didn't expect you
to be his bosom friend.

14:48.745 --> 14:49.905
Nonsense.

14:50.645 --> 14:51.961
You owe me 500 coins.

14:51.985 --> 14:53.695
You deserve your reputation.

14:54.545 --> 14:55.545
Lubricious reputation?

14:56.070 --> 14:57.841
No wonder she keeps praising you.

14:57.865 --> 14:58.865
Who do you mean?

14:59.895 --> 15:00.975
What are you talking about?

15:01.170 --> 15:02.170
OK.

15:03.470 --> 15:04.865
Bring them to me.

15:05.445 --> 15:06.242
You can tell people in the capital

15:06.266 --> 15:07.561
that I bullied you.

15:07.585 --> 15:08.905
The royal family won't blame you.

15:09.595 --> 15:10.595
No hurry.

15:11.695 --> 15:12.795
Someone wants to see you.

15:14.395 --> 15:15.545
Old Meng isn't dead, is he?

15:15.820 --> 15:16.845
You're far-sighted

15:17.220 --> 15:18.220
with iron nerves.

15:18.595 --> 15:20.195
You're great.

15:29.795 --> 15:30.795
Aunt.

15:31.245 --> 15:32.245
Fengnian.

15:36.470 --> 15:37.470
Aunt.

15:37.695 --> 15:38.695
Zhao Yutai.

15:39.320 --> 15:40.320
Do you know her?

15:40.445 --> 15:42.785
I had been hiding under
Tingchao Pavilion for years.

15:43.095 --> 15:44.771
Whenever Xu Xiao and his wife
went to see me,

15:44.795 --> 15:46.025
she stood by their side.

15:47.395 --> 15:48.795
Does she work for Xu Xiao?

15:50.120 --> 15:52.065
Do you know Xu Fengnian's mother?

15:52.895 --> 15:53.562
Yeah.

15:53.586 --> 15:54.775
She was the first person
in the mansion of Lord of North Liang

15:54.799 --> 15:56.425
who smiled at me.

15:56.645 --> 15:58.220
I still remember her.

15:58.795 --> 15:59.946
His mother's surname was Wu.

15:59.970 --> 16:01.321
She came from the Wu family,

16:01.345 --> 16:02.865
who was the last sword champion.

16:03.620 --> 16:04.896
The sword masters of the family

16:04.920 --> 16:06.895
all have their own swordsmen,

16:07.495 --> 16:09.025
who grew up with their masters.

16:11.045 --> 16:12.225
In that case,

16:13.225 --> 16:15.225
she was the Consort's swordsman?

16:15.895 --> 16:17.305
She was a sister

16:17.820 --> 16:19.060
rather than a swordsman to her.

16:19.695 --> 16:21.295
No wonder he called her Aunt.

16:22.120 --> 16:23.295
Don't be sad.

16:23.495 --> 16:24.671
(Sword Tomb of the Wu family)
I'm not sad.

16:24.695 --> 16:25.721
(Swordsman Zhao Yutai)

16:25.745 --> 16:26.745
I'm happy.

16:29.470 --> 16:30.905
After my mother died,

16:31.520 --> 16:32.825
you got disappeared.

16:33.395 --> 16:35.275
Have you been imprisoned here
by him ever since?

16:38.420 --> 16:39.745
He's my husband.

16:43.795 --> 16:44.945
Then...

16:45.570 --> 16:46.825
Why did he do this to me?

16:48.170 --> 16:49.495
During your travel,

16:49.720 --> 16:51.185
you made many friends.

16:52.195 --> 16:53.221
With your status,

16:53.245 --> 16:54.825
you've been watched by many people.

16:55.345 --> 16:58.105
Those with ulterior motives
may use your friends against you.

16:59.145 --> 17:00.995
I took them to Qingyang Sect

17:01.695 --> 17:03.321
in order to protect them.

17:03.345 --> 17:04.585
That's right, Mr. Xu.

17:05.195 --> 17:07.025
They're very kind to me.

17:08.545 --> 17:09.545
Then...

17:10.545 --> 17:11.745
Where is Old Meng?

17:13.270 --> 17:14.616
They've been sent to

17:14.640 --> 17:15.905
North Liang.

17:16.170 --> 17:17.170
Now,

17:17.395 --> 17:18.425
they have land.

17:18.695 --> 17:19.865
They're doing very well.

17:19.970 --> 17:21.785
Master said I'm talented.

17:21.920 --> 17:24.401
I'm a disciple of Shenxiao Sect, too.

17:24.425 --> 17:25.945
Have you taken my aunt as your master?

17:26.295 --> 17:28.305
Her master is your uncle.

17:30.445 --> 17:30.947
Well...

17:30.971 --> 17:33.345
Wasn't he granted as Lord of Qingcheng?

17:38.225 --> 17:40.670
Qingyang Sect has been hostile
to North Liang over the years.

17:40.995 --> 17:42.281
Isn't it real?

17:42.305 --> 17:43.505
It's our plot.

17:43.845 --> 17:45.745
We keep an eye on the capital
for North Liang.

17:46.045 --> 17:47.385
Does Xu Xiao know it?

17:47.995 --> 17:49.145
Of course.

17:50.645 --> 17:52.151
You have a good talk.

17:52.175 --> 17:53.470
I'll look around

17:53.745 --> 17:55.105
in case anyone will see you.

17:57.045 --> 17:57.802
Mr. Xu,

17:57.826 --> 17:59.225
see you later.

18:03.145 --> 18:05.025
If anything I've been doing these years

18:05.220 --> 18:06.585
leaks out,

18:06.770 --> 18:08.445
it will cause a great disturbance.

18:09.570 --> 18:11.345
General dares not tell anybody

18:11.845 --> 18:13.545
for fearing it might put me in danger.

18:13.720 --> 18:15.105
What a big plan.

18:16.225 --> 18:18.245
Qingyang Sect is actually on our side.

18:18.720 --> 18:20.671
In the future, when our cavalry
come out of North Liang,

18:20.695 --> 18:22.415
they'll meet no obstacle
at Mount Qingcheng.

18:22.695 --> 18:24.585
It won't strangle our throat again.

18:24.995 --> 18:26.895
Except for Qingyang Sect,

18:27.870 --> 18:29.465
I'm doing

18:30.145 --> 18:31.465
more important things.

18:34.170 --> 18:36.425
Is there anything more important?

18:37.245 --> 18:38.345
These years,

18:39.645 --> 18:41.225
I've been investigating

18:41.645 --> 18:43.425
your mother's murderer.

18:44.370 --> 18:45.025
Ah.

18:45.095 --> 18:46.095
Who?

18:47.370 --> 18:48.361
Go, quickly.

18:48.385 --> 18:49.121
Aunt, don't worry.

18:49.145 --> 18:50.145
They're with me.

18:53.745 --> 18:54.761
I don't care about

18:54.785 --> 18:55.945
what happened to your family.

18:57.520 --> 18:58.905
Why are you there?

19:00.295 --> 19:01.795
It's the old man's fault.

19:02.070 --> 19:03.070
Ah.

19:06.045 --> 19:07.361
Is there a ladder?

19:07.385 --> 19:08.505
I'm going down now.

19:08.595 --> 19:09.321
Jiang Ni.

19:09.345 --> 19:10.345
A maid of mine.

19:10.995 --> 19:11.995
Maid?

19:12.670 --> 19:13.561
Like a concubine?

19:13.585 --> 19:14.385
No.

19:14.520 --> 19:15.585
No!

19:20.345 --> 19:21.945
(Mount Qingcheng)
He hasn't come out yet.

19:22.245 --> 19:23.385
Shall we go in?

19:23.570 --> 19:24.570
There's no need.

19:24.870 --> 19:27.345
God of Sword and Jiang Ni
are no longer in the carriage.

19:30.970 --> 19:31.985
You mean...

19:33.045 --> 19:34.465
They are already in probably.

19:36.820 --> 19:37.820
Good.

19:38.395 --> 19:39.322
God of Sword

19:39.346 --> 19:40.785
will ensure his safety.

19:42.195 --> 19:43.265
Which one do you mean?

19:44.495 --> 19:45.865
Is there another God of Sword?

19:46.395 --> 19:48.505
The one armed man, Li Chungang.

19:48.895 --> 19:50.065
Isn't he dead yet?

19:50.395 --> 19:51.395
Not yet.

19:55.545 --> 19:56.585
Excuse me, sir.

19:57.105 --> 19:58.420
I didn't mean that.

20:02.995 --> 20:04.105
Sir, may I ask

20:04.670 --> 20:05.670
where is His Highness?

20:06.120 --> 20:07.120
Inside.

20:09.020 --> 20:10.395
Then why did you come out?

20:10.845 --> 20:11.921
I had too much breakfast.

20:11.945 --> 20:13.705
I'm a little sleepy.
Let me take a nap first.

20:13.795 --> 20:14.602
Don't worry.

20:14.626 --> 20:16.065
I left Jiang Ni there.

20:27.225 --> 20:29.020
What's the use of Jiang Ni?

20:31.345 --> 20:32.870
Since Mr. Li is back,

20:33.745 --> 20:35.745
I don't think there would be
any serious danger.

20:42.920 --> 20:44.361
I'll retire, then.

20:44.385 --> 20:45.385
You don't have to.

20:46.170 --> 20:47.170
Aunt, go ahead.

20:47.320 --> 20:48.880
You can tell her anything
concerning me.

20:49.945 --> 20:51.041
You just said

20:51.065 --> 20:52.905
you've been investigating
my mother's murderer.

20:53.470 --> 20:54.470
Yes.

20:55.145 --> 20:56.705
I've been doing that

20:57.305 --> 20:58.625
since her death.

21:01.145 --> 21:02.745
Did you find anything?

21:04.145 --> 21:05.545
When your mother died,

21:05.670 --> 21:07.320
General and I

21:07.895 --> 21:09.825
found she was seriously wounded.

21:10.695 --> 21:11.447
But she

21:11.471 --> 21:13.270
wouldn't tell us the murderer.

21:13.470 --> 21:14.695
The murderer must be powerful.

21:15.270 --> 21:17.195
My mother didn't want us
to take revenge for her.

21:17.795 --> 21:18.825
Over the years,

21:19.595 --> 21:21.425
I investigated the date step by step

21:22.185 --> 21:23.625
and examined the cause of her death.

21:24.520 --> 21:25.820
I can probably guess

21:26.220 --> 21:27.545
when she was wounded.

21:28.295 --> 21:29.665
She once

21:30.070 --> 21:31.385
went to the capital alone.

21:32.120 --> 21:33.145
She might

21:33.465 --> 21:35.105
get wounded during the trip.

21:36.105 --> 21:37.145
When was it exactly?

21:39.420 --> 21:41.345
She was pregnant with you
at the time.

21:43.220 --> 21:44.820
The murderer was in the capital.

21:46.045 --> 21:47.470
Have you found who it was?

21:48.095 --> 21:49.095
Not yet.

21:49.745 --> 21:51.785
I couldn't find anything.

21:51.985 --> 21:53.025
But the result

21:53.345 --> 21:54.665
is very illustrative itself.

21:55.420 --> 21:57.185
The murderer must be powerful enough

21:57.870 --> 21:59.985
to erase all the clues in the capital.

22:01.270 --> 22:03.070
General asked me to

22:03.505 --> 22:04.785
spread rumors

22:05.095 --> 22:06.345
in Qingcheng

22:06.620 --> 22:07.845
of your uncle being lecherous.

22:08.270 --> 22:09.785
What's his plan?

22:11.385 --> 22:14.145
He also asked me to pass some words.

22:14.895 --> 22:15.895
He said,

22:16.245 --> 22:18.396
you don't want to
take over North Liang

22:18.420 --> 22:19.561
in his way.

22:19.585 --> 22:20.585
Yes.

22:21.620 --> 22:22.881
Did you kill

22:22.905 --> 22:24.270
those mountain bandits?

22:26.865 --> 22:27.865
Yes.

22:28.105 --> 22:29.495
If it were him,

22:29.625 --> 22:31.345
he would also kill them

22:31.545 --> 22:33.081
to avenge the dead.

22:33.105 --> 22:34.820
Did he arrange that?

22:35.245 --> 22:36.245
Yes.

22:36.845 --> 22:38.645
The government surrounded them
from all sides

22:38.825 --> 22:40.820
to force them to Qingcheng.

22:41.425 --> 22:42.425
Those bandits

22:42.665 --> 22:44.645
were sent to test your ability.

22:45.025 --> 22:46.645
General also guessed

22:46.985 --> 22:48.545
you would break into the palace alone.

22:49.225 --> 22:50.970
He said in advance that

22:51.225 --> 22:52.681
your mind and means

22:52.705 --> 22:54.495
were very much like his.

22:56.225 --> 22:58.245
He said you wanted to take a new path.

22:59.345 --> 23:00.520
But in the end,

23:00.865 --> 23:03.345
you still took the path
he had paved for you.

23:06.505 --> 23:07.505
I know

23:08.185 --> 23:10.020
you blamed him

23:10.305 --> 23:12.670
on refusing to investigate
your mother's death.

23:13.545 --> 23:15.145
But you must understand

23:15.865 --> 23:17.570
it involves too many people.

23:18.065 --> 23:19.220
We must keep it secret.

23:20.665 --> 23:21.665
I know.

23:22.265 --> 23:23.620
General said

23:23.945 --> 23:25.170
you were unwilling to kill,

23:25.985 --> 23:27.495
but it turned out

23:27.905 --> 23:29.320
when it was time to kill,

23:29.465 --> 23:30.920
you wouldn't hesitate.

23:31.665 --> 23:33.270
You and General

23:33.945 --> 23:35.595
are just alike.

23:35.665 --> 23:36.665
No.

23:36.985 --> 23:38.170
I'm not like him.

23:38.785 --> 23:39.945
I won't sacrifice my family.

23:40.385 --> 23:42.295
It isn't my place

23:42.905 --> 23:44.220
to get involved between you.

23:45.145 --> 23:46.865
But General told me,

23:47.505 --> 23:49.120
when you come up the mountain,

23:49.865 --> 23:51.241
I must tell you all the clues I've found

23:51.265 --> 23:53.345
during the investigation.

23:54.065 --> 23:56.370
From now on,
no matter how many years it takes,

23:57.145 --> 23:59.020
even if General and I are dead,

23:59.825 --> 24:01.670
you must follow up

24:02.665 --> 24:03.945
and avenge your mother.

24:04.305 --> 24:05.570
I'll follow up

24:05.945 --> 24:07.195
even if he doesn't ask me to.

24:09.625 --> 24:11.045
Please wait a minute.

24:11.625 --> 24:12.985
I'll get you something.

24:13.345 --> 24:14.345
OK.

24:16.985 --> 24:18.445
You hold on too tight.

24:23.505 --> 24:24.505
Does it hurt?

24:24.545 --> 24:25.545
No.

24:32.705 --> 24:33.705
I'm sorry.

24:34.465 --> 24:35.820
Why didn't you remind me?

24:43.465 --> 24:45.195
Your mother was a nice person.

24:47.265 --> 24:49.420
I remember when I first
got to the mansion,

24:50.945 --> 24:53.170
I was scared and sad.

24:53.945 --> 24:55.270
It was her gentleness

24:55.545 --> 24:57.720
that comforted me
during the most difficult times.

25:00.665 --> 25:01.670
Xu Fengnian.

25:03.265 --> 25:05.320
I'd like to
avenge your mother with you.

25:12.795 --> 25:15.625
But we're still bitter rivals.

25:30.795 --> 25:32.520
Here are all the clues

25:33.070 --> 25:34.745
I've found

25:35.370 --> 25:36.695
during the investigation.

25:44.465 --> 25:46.281
When did you marry Wu Lingsu?

25:46.305 --> 25:48.671
Before I joined Shenxiao Sect.

25:48.695 --> 25:50.175
Then we had Shizhen.

25:50.225 --> 25:51.820
He is about your age.

25:51.945 --> 25:52.945
Where is he?

25:54.045 --> 25:55.045
In the capital.

25:57.095 --> 25:59.025
Your uncle was granted as
Lord of Qingcheng

25:59.370 --> 26:01.145
and under orders to oppose North Liang.

26:01.920 --> 26:03.465
Outwardly, he is powerful.

26:04.220 --> 26:05.745
Is he taken hostage?

26:07.195 --> 26:09.065
As long as my real identity
is not revealed,

26:09.420 --> 26:10.425
he'll be fine.

26:11.120 --> 26:13.185
We must find a way to save him.

26:15.920 --> 26:17.195
You don't have to

26:17.845 --> 26:19.170
worry about him.

26:20.495 --> 26:21.945
Read this thoroughly

26:23.270 --> 26:24.305
and burn it.

26:27.395 --> 26:28.395
Where are you going?

26:28.895 --> 26:30.545
I have some errands to run.

26:30.845 --> 26:31.985
I'll come back soon.

26:55.245 --> 26:56.585
Why don't you read it to me?

26:56.870 --> 26:57.945
One coin per word.

26:58.220 --> 26:59.305
Are you crazy?

26:59.520 --> 27:01.761
Your aunt has been concealed
her real name to investigate the case.

27:01.785 --> 27:02.561
It's important.

27:02.585 --> 27:03.445
How can you let me read it?

27:03.520 --> 27:04.520
It doesn't matter.

27:05.520 --> 27:06.785
Read it on yourself.

27:56.895 --> 27:58.255
What message did you send?

28:01.895 --> 28:03.105
How long has it been

28:03.520 --> 28:04.720
since we last saw Shizhen?

28:05.570 --> 28:08.145
There's no one in the capital
he can trust.

28:08.865 --> 28:10.665
He carries his life in his hands.

28:11.995 --> 28:13.945
Tell me what message did you send.

28:16.195 --> 28:17.985
Details of Xu Fengnian's visit.

28:18.170 --> 28:20.025
It was supposed to be sent
to the capital.

28:20.595 --> 28:21.745
If we tell them

28:22.520 --> 28:23.970
Xu Fengnian broke the sword array,

28:24.145 --> 28:26.841
they'll trust us more.

28:26.865 --> 28:27.870
What else?

28:31.770 --> 28:33.385
Layout of the North Liang barracks.

28:33.825 --> 28:34.825
Only by doing this,

28:34.945 --> 28:36.470
could Shizhen come home.

28:37.305 --> 28:39.220
Her Grace treated me like a sister.

28:40.045 --> 28:41.170
I owe her

28:41.545 --> 28:42.545
my life.

28:43.945 --> 28:45.695
It's just the layout of barracks.

28:45.945 --> 28:47.121
Nothing confidential.

28:47.145 --> 28:48.665
Who asked you to do this?

28:48.985 --> 28:50.171
I don't need anyone to tell me

28:50.195 --> 28:51.195
how to save my son.

28:53.145 --> 28:55.420
You've been uneasy since last time

28:56.385 --> 28:58.120
when Shizhen sent a letter to us.

29:00.095 --> 29:01.695
Did he ask you to do this?

29:06.270 --> 29:08.345
He wants to escape the danger

29:08.545 --> 29:09.825
and come home.

29:10.785 --> 29:11.505
Has Shizhen

29:11.595 --> 29:12.770
turned to the royal family

29:13.745 --> 29:15.265
in the capital?

29:15.570 --> 29:16.585
Of course not.

29:18.170 --> 29:19.385
Good.

29:21.305 --> 29:22.745
Don't you want him to come back?

29:24.270 --> 29:25.865
Do you really want to

29:26.425 --> 29:27.521
sacrifice our son for North Liang?

29:27.545 --> 29:30.041
General has left for the capital.

29:30.065 --> 29:31.505
Did he tell you

29:31.670 --> 29:32.865
he would rescue Shizhen?

29:33.620 --> 29:34.670
No, he didn't.

29:35.105 --> 29:36.345
How can you believe him, then?

29:37.970 --> 29:39.825
If General doesn't

29:40.420 --> 29:42.195
bring Shizhen back this time,

29:42.465 --> 29:43.970
I'll go to the capital myself

29:44.505 --> 29:45.645
to rescue our son.

29:50.505 --> 29:51.670
If you really

29:52.695 --> 29:54.455
sent the military intelligence

29:55.025 --> 29:56.320
to the capital,

29:57.825 --> 30:00.465
I'd have no choice but to kill myself
in front of Her Grace's tomb.

30:08.320 --> 30:09.320
Fine.

30:10.025 --> 30:11.025
I won't send the letter.

30:12.225 --> 30:13.245
Don't tell Fengnian

30:14.545 --> 30:16.195
about this.

30:17.345 --> 30:18.345
Yeah.

31:13.825 --> 31:14.845
Have you done with it?

31:18.225 --> 31:19.620
My mother's murderer

31:21.065 --> 31:22.870
was from the royal family of Liyang.

31:23.945 --> 31:25.970
There's no concrete clue, isn't there?

31:26.670 --> 31:27.681
It recorded the time

31:27.705 --> 31:29.570
when my mother went to the capital.

31:30.545 --> 31:31.870
Two points.

31:32.665 --> 31:33.665
One,

31:34.105 --> 31:35.305
she was just pregnant with me.

31:35.905 --> 31:36.905
Two,

31:37.625 --> 31:39.945
Xu Xiao was about to be granted as
the Lord of North Liang.

31:45.705 --> 31:46.845
They had no choice

31:47.305 --> 31:49.845
but to grant your father as the lord.

31:50.545 --> 31:51.995
He conquered the six kingdoms.

31:52.105 --> 31:54.445
They couldn't convince the public
if they didn't do that.

31:55.265 --> 31:56.705
But the royal family

31:57.305 --> 32:00.095
definitely didn't want North Liang
to have a young master.

32:00.985 --> 32:02.545
So my mother's pregnancy

32:03.225 --> 32:05.570
was what they feared most.

32:06.065 --> 32:08.695
It turns out your enemy
is the royal family.

32:09.665 --> 32:10.665
Yes.

32:11.945 --> 32:14.095
Your father could
draw the conclusion, too.

32:14.545 --> 32:16.370
Why didn't he

32:16.705 --> 32:18.020
rebel against the capital?

32:18.385 --> 32:19.495
If he rebelled,

32:19.985 --> 32:21.795
the world would fall apart.

32:22.625 --> 32:24.270
Numerous people would die.

32:24.825 --> 32:27.145
For that reason,
you give up taking revenge?

32:28.745 --> 32:29.870
No, I won't.

32:30.225 --> 32:32.506
I just don't want to take revenge
at the expense of peace.

32:32.665 --> 32:33.705
What do you mean?

32:35.585 --> 32:37.520
If they sent out troops at the time,

32:38.185 --> 32:39.905
my mother couldn't
leave the capital alive.

32:41.385 --> 32:42.481
I think they dare not

32:42.505 --> 32:44.470
take action in public.

32:44.945 --> 32:46.720
They must've tried to assassinate her.

32:47.625 --> 32:48.801
My mother was the top talent

32:48.825 --> 32:51.041
of Sword Tomb of the Wu family
in nearly a hundred years.

32:51.065 --> 32:52.065
They needed a real master

32:52.425 --> 32:53.425
to kill her.

32:53.585 --> 32:55.270
There might be more than one assassin.

33:00.785 --> 33:02.721
I'll find out the assassins
who ambushed her

33:02.745 --> 33:04.270
one by one

33:05.425 --> 33:07.445
and take their heads with my own hands

33:07.905 --> 33:09.170
to pay homage to her.

33:18.465 --> 33:19.645
One day,

33:19.745 --> 33:22.270
I'll go to the capital
to find out the truth myself.

33:24.305 --> 33:25.995
Your mother left something to you.

33:27.025 --> 33:28.025
What is it?

33:28.465 --> 33:29.465
Follow me.

33:37.785 --> 33:39.345
I'll wait here for you.

33:48.020 --> 33:50.020
It's far from Qingyang Sect, isn't it?

33:50.425 --> 33:52.265
Qingyang Sect has attracted
too much attention.

33:52.385 --> 33:54.120
Her Grace preferred quietness.

34:06.745 --> 34:07.745
What's this?

34:10.625 --> 34:11.820
Her Grace and I

34:11.905 --> 34:13.395
were from Wu Family.

34:13.545 --> 34:14.545
I know.

34:14.625 --> 34:17.370
Sword Tomb of the Wu family
was once the top sect of swordplay.

34:17.625 --> 34:19.070
Not anymore.

34:19.545 --> 34:20.481
Li Chungang.

34:20.505 --> 34:21.402
Deng Tai'e.

34:21.426 --> 34:22.495
Jian Jiuhuang.

34:22.865 --> 34:25.245
Top masters of swordplay
emerge without end.

34:26.225 --> 34:27.770
The Wu Family

34:28.065 --> 34:29.721
has lost on fate already.

34:29.745 --> 34:31.220
But it still has foundation.

34:32.585 --> 34:33.585
Foundation

34:33.865 --> 34:34.970
and family rules.

34:36.225 --> 34:37.470
Back in the time,

34:37.585 --> 34:39.895
Her Grace wasn't allowed
to be with General.

34:40.785 --> 34:42.570
She broke up with her family

34:42.665 --> 34:44.185
and went to Liaodong on a white horse.

34:44.545 --> 34:46.345
So they finally got together

34:46.645 --> 34:48.170
and then they had you.

34:49.545 --> 34:51.320
The Wu family must be mad.

34:56.185 --> 34:57.645
After the members of the family die,

34:58.065 --> 35:00.145
their swords should be returned
to the Sword Tomb.

35:01.385 --> 35:02.545
But Her Grace

35:03.145 --> 35:05.045
was an outcast from her family.

35:06.065 --> 35:07.065
Her sword

35:07.745 --> 35:09.295
couldn't be sent back.

35:12.065 --> 35:14.270
That's why

35:15.345 --> 35:16.745
I sealed up her sword here.

35:19.505 --> 35:21.570
She told me before she died,

35:22.545 --> 35:23.670
if you

35:23.865 --> 35:25.470
choose to practice martial arts,

35:27.105 --> 35:28.670
her sword

35:29.625 --> 35:30.970
would be left to you.

35:45.345 --> 35:47.020
North Liang overran the whole world.

35:47.505 --> 35:49.095
Her Grace

35:49.985 --> 35:52.545
(Daliang Dragon Sparrow)
had defeated many heroes with the sword.

35:59.745 --> 36:01.245
Her Grace also said,

36:01.705 --> 36:02.770
if you

36:03.065 --> 36:04.681
meet a good girl one day,

36:04.705 --> 36:06.495
who happens to practice swordplay,

36:07.705 --> 36:09.905
the sword would be left to her
as the betrothal present.

36:12.145 --> 36:13.171
I'm afraid I won't meet anyone

36:13.195 --> 36:14.745
like my mother.

36:16.865 --> 36:18.625
As long as you like her,

36:19.305 --> 36:21.045
she is the best in the world.

36:34.425 --> 36:36.045
The big one in the mountain.

36:39.585 --> 36:41.220
Are you Xiaoque'er?

36:47.745 --> 36:49.195
Big one?

36:49.505 --> 36:50.745
Is it a tiger?

36:53.145 --> 36:54.270
It's a monster.

37:01.095 --> 37:03.220
It's fair to call it a monster.

37:05.265 --> 37:07.370
It's a strange beast
in Mount Qingcheng

37:07.625 --> 37:08.845
called Hukui.

37:09.225 --> 37:10.445
It's extremely fierce.

37:11.045 --> 37:12.045
Have you seen it?

37:12.145 --> 37:13.145
I once fought it.

37:13.705 --> 37:15.145
It couldn't defeat me.

37:15.395 --> 37:16.920
I couldn't defeat it, either.

37:21.585 --> 37:22.945
It's a fight.

37:24.065 --> 37:25.170
How strange!

37:25.425 --> 37:27.745
There's no beast in Mount Qingcheng
that can fight it.

37:32.545 --> 37:33.745
Xu Fengnian

37:33.865 --> 37:35.120
will be back soon.

37:37.305 --> 37:39.025
Mr. Xu is very nice.

37:39.465 --> 37:40.770
He taught me to blow leaves.

37:41.670 --> 37:43.245
I thought at the time

37:43.545 --> 37:46.025
I would be his matchmaker

37:46.145 --> 37:47.721
and arrange him a good marriage.

37:47.745 --> 37:48.370
Yeah.

37:48.625 --> 37:49.625
However,

37:49.865 --> 37:51.420
he has you now.

37:54.720 --> 37:55.745
Wait.

37:56.720 --> 37:57.960
What do you mean?

37:58.105 --> 37:59.445
Do I have anything to do with it?

38:02.385 --> 38:04.645
I haven't found the right one for him.

38:06.045 --> 38:07.565
It's a pity.

38:08.545 --> 38:09.745
I always feel

38:09.825 --> 38:11.545
he deserves a fairy.

38:14.105 --> 38:14.770
Let's go.

38:15.105 --> 38:16.071
Already?

38:16.095 --> 38:17.095
Yes.

38:17.145 --> 38:18.596
Do you want to come with us?

38:18.620 --> 38:19.601
Mr. Xu.

38:19.625 --> 38:20.625
I have

38:20.825 --> 38:22.595
got your things off my mind just now.

38:23.495 --> 38:24.495
What things?

38:25.505 --> 38:27.570
So I can't go with you.

38:27.620 --> 38:28.620
Oh.

38:28.665 --> 38:29.665
It may not be a bad idea.

38:30.425 --> 38:31.625
We're in a hurry.

38:32.225 --> 38:33.281
When I get back,

38:33.305 --> 38:34.241
I'll come to see you.

38:34.265 --> 38:34.896
OK.

38:34.920 --> 38:35.920
I'll wait for you.

38:36.105 --> 38:37.105
It's a deal.

38:41.625 --> 38:42.625
What's up?

38:42.945 --> 38:44.145
I feel sorry for you.

38:44.865 --> 38:46.045
You don't even know

38:46.225 --> 38:48.295
you've missed a fairy.

38:49.425 --> 38:50.425
It's a favor to you.

38:56.970 --> 38:58.570
What have I missed?

38:59.065 --> 39:00.670
What's the favor?

39:01.170 --> 39:02.195
Stop asking.

39:04.025 --> 39:05.595
Is it what your mother left to you?

39:07.095 --> 39:08.295
Daliang Dragon and Sparrow.

39:08.645 --> 39:09.670
My mother's sword.

39:10.105 --> 39:11.945
You practice blade instead of sword,
don't you?

39:12.025 --> 39:13.081
This is also the betrothal present

39:13.105 --> 39:14.620
to my future wife.

39:15.395 --> 39:17.045
Isn't it a little dangerous

39:17.305 --> 39:18.795
to use a sword as betrothal present?

39:20.145 --> 39:20.840
Take it.

39:21.045 --> 39:22.045
What're you doing?

39:22.985 --> 39:24.320
You're my maid.

39:24.785 --> 39:25.682
Shouldn't you hold it for me?

39:25.706 --> 39:27.146
Or do you want me to hold it myself?

39:27.895 --> 39:28.895
That's what you mean.

39:29.145 --> 39:30.145
What do you think?

39:30.870 --> 39:31.870
Never mind.

39:34.695 --> 39:35.695
Where's your aunt?

39:37.105 --> 39:38.520
She can't walk me out,

39:39.305 --> 39:41.070
otherwise our relationship
will be disclosed.

39:41.545 --> 39:42.971
We have to let people think

39:42.995 --> 39:44.275
Qingyang Sect and I are enemies.

39:44.820 --> 39:46.145
Yeah, I get it.

39:47.270 --> 39:48.795
You can't go out from the gate.

39:50.745 --> 39:52.145
It's strange

39:52.745 --> 39:53.920
if I leave the enemy's place

39:54.145 --> 39:55.320
with a sword box.

39:55.495 --> 39:56.440
So what?

39:56.465 --> 39:58.041
You'd better go out by the side door,

39:58.065 --> 39:59.970
walk along the woods
to the mountain road ahead.

40:00.245 --> 40:02.165
I'll let the carriage
wait for you at the corner.

40:06.945 --> 40:08.121
What about 10 coins?

40:08.145 --> 40:08.721
20.

40:08.745 --> 40:09.745
Deal.

40:11.625 --> 40:13.295
I should ask for more, shouldn't I?

40:15.220 --> 40:16.720
No.

40:25.105 --> 40:26.105
Wait.

40:28.545 --> 40:29.545
Remember.

40:29.705 --> 40:30.721
Walk along the woods.

40:30.745 --> 40:31.825
Don't go into the mountain.

40:32.105 --> 40:33.361
I'm not a fool.

40:33.385 --> 40:34.820
I know the way.

40:35.865 --> 40:36.945
Keep it in your mind.

40:49.545 --> 40:50.161
Hey.

40:50.185 --> 40:51.185
He is out.

40:53.345 --> 40:56.320
(Mount Qingcheng)

41:09.105 --> 41:10.545
What you've done to me today,

41:10.905 --> 41:12.585
I'll keep it in my mind.

41:13.025 --> 41:14.195
Just wait.

41:14.395 --> 41:15.546
One day,

41:15.570 --> 41:16.850
I'll return to Mount Qingcheng.

41:17.665 --> 41:19.320
Let him go.

41:42.695 --> 41:43.995
Is this the right way?

42:02.445 --> 42:03.795
It sounds like

42:03.945 --> 42:05.495
the beast is cornered.

42:05.920 --> 42:06.970
It's strange.

42:07.445 --> 42:08.445
Which beast dares to

42:08.745 --> 42:10.620
fight Hukui?

42:11.905 --> 42:12.961
Grandpa Wei, Qingniao.

42:12.985 --> 42:14.025
Come with me to the woods.

42:21.620 --> 42:23.345
Why isn't there any sound of birds?

42:29.620 --> 42:31.095
Xu Fengnian.

42:36.065 --> 42:37.065
Is that you?

43:30.025 --> 43:32.745
♪ The flower of pain ♪

43:34.505 --> 43:37.305
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪

43:39.225 --> 43:42.145
♪ I made a bet with the dawn ♪

43:43.225 --> 43:47.025
♪ That you'll answer ♪

43:48.345 --> 43:51.225
♪ Forgive this tragic end ♪

43:52.945 --> 43:55.745
♪ Moved by the moment we met ♪

43:57.745 --> 44:00.505
♪ In spite of thunder and lightning ♪

44:01.545 --> 44:05.465
♪ In spite of my falling ♪

44:05.945 --> 44:08.681
♪ When we are apart ♪

44:08.705 --> 44:09.945
♪ I'll collapse ♪

44:10.745 --> 44:14.585
♪ Capture an image of the memory ♪

44:15.425 --> 44:18.121
♪ After all these ups and downs ♪

44:18.145 --> 44:19.585
♪ The vanity ♪

44:20.105 --> 44:23.945
♪ Who will open it again ♪

44:24.385 --> 44:25.721
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:25.745 --> 44:28.585
♪ It's enough ♪

44:29.025 --> 44:31.481
♪ Drowned in sadness ♪

44:31.505 --> 44:33.905
♪ Just to see through ♪

44:34.225 --> 44:36.241
♪ I will whisper love to you ♪

44:36.265 --> 44:38.441
♪ For a lifetime ♪

44:38.465 --> 44:42.665
♪ End the worry in the world ♪

44:43.025 --> 44:44.161
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:44.185 --> 44:47.225
♪ I'll be there for you all my life ♪

44:47.425 --> 44:49.361
♪ After the moments of beauty ♪

44:49.385 --> 44:52.105
♪ You are my reason to be ♪

44:52.665 --> 44:54.481
♪ If there is a way ♪

44:54.505 --> 44:57.001
♪ To start over ♪

44:57.025 --> 45:01.145
♪ Will you still remember me ♪
